# Avoid copying development artifacts and secrets into the build context.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.git/
**/.github/

# Test outputs and coverage reports.
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
**/*.coverage
**/coveragereport/

# Local databases and SQLite artefacts.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

# Local logs that would only add noise.
**/Logs/

# Documentation and planning artefacts (kept outside the runtime image).
docs/
plan.md
README.md

# Editor / OS noise.
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Keep .editorconfig available during restore for analyzer configuration.
!**/.editorconfig
